OL,3,ACall with couple in Iran prison
OL,4,A'enormous relief'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of an East Sussex couple
OL,7,Fdetained in Iran say they have spoken
OL,8,Fto them for the first time in three
OL,9,Fmonths.
OL,11,FLindsay and Craig Foreman were
OL,12,Fsentenced to 10 years in jail over
OL,13,Fespionage charges, which they both
OL,14,Fdeny, and are being held in Evin
OL,15,Fprison.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
