OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACall with couple in Iran prison
OL,4,A'enormous relief'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLindsay's son, Joe Bennett, said
OL,7,Fhearing his mum's voice was "an
OL,8,Fenormous relief" and encouraged the
OL,9,Fgovernment to visit the couple as the
OL,10,FUK embassy in Iran reopened last week
OL,11,Fafter closing due to ongoing security
OL,12,Fconcerns in the region.
OL,14,FA Foreign, Commonwealth & Development
OL,15,FOffice (FCDO) spokesperson confirmed
OL,16,Fstaff had returned to the embassy and
OL,17,Fsaid the pair's health and welfare was
OL,18,Fa "top priority".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
